        },
        {
          "text": "Ikawa baadaye, mfalme wa wana wa Amori akafa, akamiliki Hanuni, mwanawe, mahali pake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Daudi akasema, Nitamtendea wema Hanuni, mwana wa Nahasi, kama babaye alivyonitendea wema mimi. Basi Daudi akatuma kwa mkono wa watumishi wake, ili kumtuliza kwa habari za babaye. Wakaja watumishi wa Daudi katika nchi ya wana wa Amoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lakini wakuu wa wana wa Amoni wakamwambia Hanuni, bwana wao, Je! Waona ya kuwa Daudi amemheshimu babayo kwa kutuma kwako wafariji? Je! Daudi hakuwapeleka watumishi wake kwako ili kuuangalia mji, na kuupeleleza, na kuuangamiza? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
