            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na wana wa Amoni walipoona ya kuwa wamekuwa machukizo kwa Daudi, wana wa Amoni wakatuma na kuwaajiri Washami wa Bethrehobu, na Washami wa Soba, askari ishirini elfu, na mfalme wa Maaka mwenye watu elfu, na watu wa Tobu watu kumi na mbili elfu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.23.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam 23:8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Daudi aliposikia akamtuma Yoabu, na jeshi lote la mashujaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wana wa Amoni wakatoka, wakapanga vita mahali pa kuingilia lango; na Washami wa Soba, na wa Rehobu, na watu wa Tobu, na wa Maaka, walikuwa peke yao uwandani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi Yoabu alipoona ya kwamba uso wa vita umekuwa juu yake mbele na nyuma, akachagua baadhi ya wateule wote wa Israeli, akawapanga juu ya Washami; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "akawatia nguvu watu waliosalia mkononi mwa Abishai, nduguye, akawapanga juu ya wana wa Amoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akasema, Wakiwa Washami hodari mno kwangu, ndipo wewe utanisaidia, lakini wana wa Amoni wakiwa ni hodari mno kwako, ndipo mimi nitakuja nikusaidie wewe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
